'''Captain Baha''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Fisherman's Hut}} who allows players to access the [[Ship]]. He can also be found on the Ship in the {{Zone|Backwater Bayou}} and {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Purpose ==
'''Captain Baha''' allows the player to access the [[Ship]], after reaching {{Skill|Fishing|5}} and bringing him the {{Item|Rusty Ship Engine}}. The ship features the [[Ship Navigator]], which can be used to visit various [[Fishing]] islands.

